    This multi-semester major specialization provides systematic study and practice of tennis. It covers tennis theory, technical and tactical development, competition rules, organization and scheduling, and teaching and training knowledge. The specialization is designed to develop advanced sport-specific competence together with practical capacity for tennis instruction and organization.
